course: dictionary
lesson: 14407
title: Too many in one place
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Overcrowd means to put or let too many people or things into a place, so that it becomes too full. «The bus was so overcrowded that Sam could not reach the bell.» Sam's bus had too many people on it, so it was too full.
explain: Overcrowded is the word you will meet most often. It is an adjective, so it describes a place that is too full to be comfortable or safe.
explain: Look for clues in the sentence. If people cannot move, cannot sit down or cannot get out, the place is probably overcrowded. Check by swapping in "too full": if it still makes sense, you have the right meaning.
fact: Overcrowd is a verb: overcrowd, overcrowds, overcrowded, overcrowding.
fact: «Overcrowded» is an adjective. It describes a place that has too many people or things in it.
fact: An overcrowded place can be dangerous, because people cannot move freely or get out quickly.
fact: In science, overcrowded plants or animals compete for food, light and space, and they may get ill.
fact: Buses, trains, classrooms, cities, prisons, fish tanks and gardens can all become overcrowded.
exercise: «The bus was so overcrowded that Sam could not reach the bell.» What does overcrowded mean here? | Empty and quiet | Painted bright red | Driving very fast | *Too full of people to be comfortable
exercise: In a garden, what do overcrowded plants have to fight for? | Cars and trains | Clouds and rain | *Food, light and space | Sweets and toys
exercise: «Too many people were pushed into the lift, so it was overcrowded and unsafe.» Find and copy the word that means too full. | lift | *overcrowded | unsafe | people
test: «The prison cells were overcrowded, so the people inside could not move easily.» What does overcrowded mean? | Locked for the night | *Too full to be comfortable or safe | Very cold | Newly painted
test: «The fans will overcrowd the stadium if the doors open too late.» What does overcrowd mean here? | To leave a place empty | To paint a place | To clean a place | *To put too many people into a place
exam: Ellie says the fish tank is overcrowded. What is the danger for the fish? | *They compete for food and space and may get ill | They grow wings and fly away | They become brighter in colour | They fall asleep for a whole week
